Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森先生 请说出你的全名 便于案件记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Magnussen, please state your full name for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯·奥古斯都·麦努森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Augustus Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Magnussen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为你对首相的影响力如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}how would you describe your influence over the Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国首相?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何你认识的英国首相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of the British Prime Ministers you have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对任何首相都没有影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had the slightest influence over any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么能影响首相?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到 今年你在唐宁街参与了七次会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I notice you've had seven meetings at Downing Street this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我受到了邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能否回忆起会谈的内容?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you recall the subjects under discussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为内容都很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without being more indiscreet than I believe is appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得 作为一位报社社长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it right that a newspaper proprietor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个个人 事实上还是一位外籍人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}a private individual, and in fact a foreign national,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与我们的首相进行如此经常性会晤是否正常?\N{\fnArial\fs30}should have such regular access to our Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得 作为个人 接受邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's wrong that a private individual should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}accept an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 我真诚地道歉 我是一个外国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, you have my sincere apologies for being foreign.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思 这怎么可能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I meant. That is not in any way...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森先生 你是否记得在一些情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Magnussen, can you recall an occasion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的意见以任何形式影响了政府政策?\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your remarks could have influenced a government policy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或首相的思路呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the Prime Minister's thinking in any way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伊丽莎白·斯莫尔伍德女士)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(弱点: 丈夫)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的记忆力很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an excellent memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的车就停在外面... 明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your car is waiting outside... See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能坐那吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这并不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确实不合适  - 麦努森先生 除了在质询会上 我们不能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It isn't.  - Mr Magnussen, outside the inquiry, we can have no contact,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何接触或交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}no communication at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1982年 你丈夫与海伦·凯瑟琳·得利斯科尔通信\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1982, your husband corresponded with Helen Catherine Driscoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我认识他之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was before I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些信可真是生动 充满爱意...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letters were lively, loving...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些还很露骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}some would say explicit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些信目前在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And currently in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能把你的手拿开?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please move your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"亲爱的 我渴望抚摸你的... 胴体"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I long, my darling, to know the touch of your... body."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道信里有这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what was in the letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她才15岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她看上去很成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked older.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.75,0:03:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 她看上去也很诱人 我们还有照片为证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she looked delicious. We have photographs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她寄给他的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones she sent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真美味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yum-yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他那时不知道她的年龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was unaware of her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在通信之前 他只见过她一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He met her only once before the letters began.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他发现真相后 马上就停止了通信\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he discovered the truth, he stopped immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实是历史书里才有的东西 我是做新闻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facts are for history books. I work in news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手在出汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand is sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在出汗 不好意思 我有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always, I'm afraid. I have a condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个世界都在我的股掌之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world is wet to my touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要叫保安把你赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will call someone, I will have you removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么味道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月色?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire de la Lune?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用有点年轻 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit young for you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在想打我? 还有力气吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hit me now? Could you, still?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你只是个小老女人罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little old lady now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你该收拾收拾准备叫人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should settle for calling someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不叫了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.27,0:04:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为现在有结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because now there are consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手里有那些信 因此你就在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the letters and therefore I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是敲诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这显然不是敲诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it isn't blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有权\N{\fnArial\fs30}ownership.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并没有拥有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not own me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire de la Lune.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它尝起来可没有闻起来好 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never tastes like it smells, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.87,0:05:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯莫尔伍德女士的消费记在我账上 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Smallwood's bill is on me. See to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.79,0:05:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 麦努森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊! 哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您没事吧 夫人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人反对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one stands up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人敢对付他 甚至都没人试着对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one dares, no one even tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在英国没有一个人能够阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a man or woman in England capable of stopping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个恶心的东西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that disgusting creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夫人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉头 我们回市区 掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the car around. We're going back into town. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去哪里 夫人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贝克街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baker Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见过很多伤员? 死状惨烈?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen a lot of injuries, then? Violent deaths?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够看一辈子的了 还想看更多吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough for a lifetime. Want to see some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《最后的誓言》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道现在很早 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's early. Really, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是凯特吗?  - 对 是凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that Kate?  - Yeah, it's Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不请她进来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invite her in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 不好意思 请进 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, sorry, yes, do you want to come in, Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.23,0:07:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给  - 是艾萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go.  - It's Isaac.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦 你丈夫?  - 是儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, your husband?  - Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又不见了 昨晚都没回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone missing again. Didn't come home last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他经常这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他吸毒 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the drugs one, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 说得真委婉 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, yeah, nicely put, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你是不是想找夏洛克·福尔摩斯? 我好久没见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is it Sherlock Holmes you want? Because I've not seen him in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大概一个月  - 谁是夏洛克·福尔摩斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About a month.  - Who is Sherlock Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吧 还是有人不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个地方他们总去 他和他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a place they all go to, him and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们做他们想做的任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all do whatever they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨一下 随便你怎么叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot up, whatever you call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他在哪?  - 那是座房子 垃圾场 实际上快塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he?  - It's a house, it's a dump. It's practically falling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我是说地址? 具体的地址?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the address? Where, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你玩真的?  - 不然呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously?  - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会去报警 总得有人去找她儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not going to the police, someone's got to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么是你?  - 要乐于助人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you?  - I'm being neighbourly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 从什么时候开始的?  - 从现在开始 从这分钟开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Since when?  - Ha, since now. Since this exact minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么...?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you being so...?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 你怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing the matter with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 设想我刚才没吼你  - 我在努力中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Imagine I said that without shouting.  - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你不能去 你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't come, you're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才不能去 你要做爸爸了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go, I'm pregnant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是轮胎撬杆  - 为什么带这个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a tyre lever.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那里有一群瘾君子 搞不好可能需要修轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos there were loads of smackheads in there and one of them might need help with a tyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有麻烦 你直接走 不用担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's any trouble, just go, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 约翰 约翰 约翰...\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, John, John, John...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还是有点小性感哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a tiny bit sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(私人财产 禁止入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想怎样?  - 借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want?  - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你不能进来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you can't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在找一个朋友 一个特定的... 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a friend. A very specific... friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是随便逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just browsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得出去 这里不允许别人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to go. No one's allowed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克·惠特尼 你见过他吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac Whitney, you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在问你 你有没有见过艾萨克·惠特尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you if you've seen Isaac Whitney
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你却拿出一把刀来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're showing me a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是线索? 你在演哑剧吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a clue? Are you doing a mime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚 否则我就一刀切了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Or I'll cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那里太远了 我来帮帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not from there. Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 集中注意力 艾萨克·惠特尼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, concentrate. Isaac Whitney?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, you asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 现在你的注意力集中了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Are you concentrating yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打断了我的胳膊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我只是扭了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I sprained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉软绵绵的 扭伤的感觉是软绵绵的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels squishy. Is it supposed to feel squishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来摸一下!  - 没错 就是扭伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feel that!  - Yeah, it's a sprain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个医生 我知道怎么扭伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor, I know how to sprain people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在回答我 艾萨克·惠特尼在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where is Isaac Whitney?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道! 可能在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! Maybe upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不就结了 不是很简单吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. Wasn't that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 很疼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was really sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疯子 你就是个疯子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mental, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 只是见多了高端罪犯而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just used to a better class of criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克? 艾萨克·惠特尼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac? Isaac Whitney?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾萨克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.59,0:10:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 给我坐直了 坐直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, mate. Sit up for me, sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 华生医生?  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr Watson?  - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和一堆垃圾窝在粪堆里 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arse-end of the universe with the scum of the earth. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是来找我的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我认识这里很多人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I know a lot of people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 约翰 没想到在这里见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, John. Didn't expect to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也来找我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come for me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 艾萨克  - 华生太太 我能不能上车?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Isaac.  - Mrs Watson, can I, can I get in, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 上车吧 约翰在哪里?  - 他们在吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, of course, get in. Where's John?  - They're having a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和谁?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 约翰 我在查案!\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God sakes, John, I'm on a case!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个月 这个月你就这么过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A month. That's all it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一晚! 我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}One! I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"夏洛克·福尔摩斯在吸毒窝点" 这个标题如何?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sherlock Holmes in a drug den." How's that going to look?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是卧底  - 不 你不是!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm undercover.  - No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 现在我不是了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车 你们两个 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}In, both of you, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行行好 能让我上车吗? 我想我胳膊断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, can I come? I think I've got a broken arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不行 走开  - 算了 让他上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, go away.  - No, let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 上来吧 只是扭伤而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why?  - Yeah, just get in. It's a sprain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有人吗? 我是说 我们要把所有人都接回家 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else? I mean, are we taking everybody home, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:40.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗 夏札?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Shezza?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏札?  - 我那时候在卧底!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shezza?  - I was undercover!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的 也别用夏札吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Shezza, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们先不回家 我们去巴特医院 我给茉莉打电话  - 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not going home, we're going to Bart's. I'm calling Molly.  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为夏洛克·福尔摩斯要做尿检\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Sherlock Holmes needs to pee in a jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了? 他没吸吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? Is he clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么敢糟蹋上天赐予你的身体!\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you throw away the beautiful gifts you were born with!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么敢辜负朋友对你的关爱!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how dare you betray the love of your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉你的婚约没了 虽然我很庆幸你手上没带戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry your engagement's over. Though I'm fairly grateful for the lack of a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吸了 别再吸了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Just stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你毒瘾快要犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were anywhere near this kind of thing again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以打电话 可以和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could have called, you could have talked to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 别激动 都是为了查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, do relax. This is all for a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的案子需要你这样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of case would need you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我或许也要问问你 为什么你开始骑自行车上班了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well ask you why you've started cycling to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我们不玩这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not playing this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在最近 而且你还下定了决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite recently, I'd say, you're very determined about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没兴趣  - 我有兴趣 疼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not interested.  - I am. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你刚才动了一下 不过只是扭伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, you moved, but it is just a sprain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 有人打了我  - 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, somebody hit me.  - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 可能只是一个瘾君子需要修理修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was probably just an addict in need of a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我想从某个方面来说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I think in a way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是他的衬衫吗?  - 你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it his shirt?  - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.79,0:13:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是衬衫的褶皱 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the creases, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有两条折痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two creases down the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,折痕是新的 但衣服不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been recently folded, but it's not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天早上一定是很匆忙地穿的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have dressed in a hurry this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你所有的衬衫都是那样叠着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all your shirts must be kept like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是因为你每天骑车去上班 到了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe cos you cycle to work every morning, shower
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会冲个澡 再换上你带的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you get there and then dress in the clothes you brought with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是把你的衬衫叠好了准备带走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep your shirts folded, ready to pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我进一步推断...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I further deduce...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最近才开始骑车的 因为你的腿好像还有点擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've only started recently because you've got a bit of chafing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒不是 他一向那样走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's always walked like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一遍 你叫什么来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me, what's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们叫我威格  - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They call me the Wig.  - No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 他们... 他们叫我维吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they... they call me Wiggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比尔 比尔·维金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Bill Wiggins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:13:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观察力不错嘛 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice observational skills, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于好了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 终于什么?  - 是好消息?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Finally what?  - Good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 这可是天大的好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excellent news, the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我重犯毒瘾的事可能要上报纸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's every chance that my drug habit might hit the newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏开始了 容我... 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is on. Excuse me... for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听说过查尔斯·奥古斯都·麦努森吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard of Charles Augustus Magnussen, of course?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.31,0:14:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 他有几家报社 但我不读那些报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Owns some newspapers. Ones I don't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下 其他人都哪去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, weren't there other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽送那两个孩子回家 我送你 我们商量好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's taking the boys home, I'm taking you, we did discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们在说话 而我又没有参与其中 我一定是把谈话过滤掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People were talking, none of them were me, I must have filtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我发现了  - 我总是过滤掉一堆没用的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I noticed.  - I have to filter out a lot of witless babble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经把哈德森太太调成半永久性静音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got Mrs Hudson on semi-permanent mute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥在这干嘛?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is my brother doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以又得我付钱了 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll just pay, then, shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他摆正了门环\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's straightened the knocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他总在纠正我 这是强迫症 他自己都不知道自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always corrects it, it's OCD, doesn't even know he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎样?  - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what?  - Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 夏洛克 老毛病又犯了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, Sherlock, back on the sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来这里干什么?  - 我给他打的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here?  - I phoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旧病复发的警报 简直和鲁迪叔叔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The siren call of old habits. How very like Uncle Rudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不过从很多方面来看 变装倒可能是一条适合你的路  - 你给他打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Though in many ways, cross-dressing would have been a wiser path for you.  - You phoned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我当然给他打电话了  - 他当然找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course I bloody phoned him.  - Of course he bloody did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长话短说吧 我们应该去哪找?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now save me a little time, where should we be looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们?  - 福尔摩斯先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We?  - Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 安德森?!  - 对不起 夏洛克 这也是为你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anderson?!  - Sorry, Sherlock, it's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他? 你描述的比他真人要高点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's him, isn't it? You said he'd be taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你粉丝团的两位成员 要礼貌点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some members of your little fan club. Do be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们绝对值得信任 而且甚至还愿意来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're entirely trustworthy and even willing to search
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你称之为公寓的有毒垃圾场\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the toxic waste dump that you are pleased to call a flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是名人了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a celebrity these days, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能染上毒瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't afford a drug habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没有染上毒瘾  - 嘿 我的椅子呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do not have a drug habit.  - Hey, what happened to my chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它挡住我看厨房的视线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was blocking my view to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 被想念的感觉真不错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's good to be missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你走了之后 我看到了一些新的机遇  - 不 你看到了厨房而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were gone, I saw an opportunity.  - No, you saw the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 到目前为止 你发现了什么?  - 显然什么都没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you found so far?  - Clearly, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可发现的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to find!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你卧室的门是关着的 而你又整夜未归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bedroom door is shut. You haven't been home all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 为什么一个妈妈不提醒就从不知道关门的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why would a man who has never knowingly closed a door without
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在突然要关门了呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}the direct orders of his mother bother to do so on this occasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下 别开门! 你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, stop, just stop! Point made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得给我们父母打电话了 当然 他们在俄克拉荷马州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall have to phone our parents, of course. In Oklahoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是你第一次因为吸毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be the first time that your substance abuse
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏他们跳广场舞的兴致了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has wreaked havoc with their line dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样 这是为了一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not what you think. This is for a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么案子才能解释这一切?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What case could possibly justify this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯·奥古斯都·麦努森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles Augustus Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们刚刚可能听到了一个名字 肯定是你们听错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That name you think you may have just heard, you were mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们胆敢对外提起 在这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever mention hearing that name in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这样的情况下听到过这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this context, I guarantee you, on behalf
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢以英国安全局的名义保证 你们电脑的硬盘里会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the British Security Services, that materials will be found on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.23,0:16:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你马上被监禁的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}your computer hard-drives, resulting in your immediate incarceration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别问 做出一副被吓坏了的样子逃跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't reply, just look frightened and scuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我不用也这样威胁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I won't have to threaten you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话我们俩都会尴尬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we'd both find that embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森的事和你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen is not your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦 你是说他是你的了?  - 你可以把他看成是受我的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you mean he's yours?  - You may consider him under my protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得是你被他控制住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consider you under his thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你胆敢跟麦努森作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go against Magnussen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:18.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就是在跟我过不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you will find yourself going against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我发现之后会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I'll let you know if I notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 我要说什么来着? 哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what was I going to say? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.23,0:17:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么做真不明智 我的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unwise, brother mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在我嗑药之后惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't appal me when I'm high.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特 别说了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, don't say another word, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能把你掰成两半 而且现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could snap you in two and right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点担心他真的会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm slightly worried that he might.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别说 走就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't speak, just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 麦努森?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, Magnussen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在几点?  - 八点左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What time is it?  - About eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我三个小时之后得见他 我要洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be meeting him in three hours. I need a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说这是为了一个案子?  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for a case, you say?  - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的案子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何理智的人都不愿意牵涉进这个危险的大案中来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too big and dangerous for any sane individual to get involved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想让我退缩?  - 才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You trying to put me off?  - God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想拉你下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to recruit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 离我卧室远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay out of my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 嗨 最近怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, John, hi. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍宁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么衣冠不整的真是不好意思 大家都走了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, not dressed. Has everybody gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我听见外面乱糟糟的  - 是啊 他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard shouting.  - Yes, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 这么晚了 我要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, look at the time. I'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听起来是在吵架 是迈克吗?  - 迈克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It sounded like an argument. Was it Mike?  - Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克 他迈克叫迈克 他们总是吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, yeah. His brother, Mike. They're always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们真的会这么叫他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do people actually call him that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah.  - Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲 能帮我煮上咖啡吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, could you be a love and put some coffee on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 玛丽怎么样? 婚后生活如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Oh, how is Mary? How's married life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她很好 我们都挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine. We're both fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在放到那边去了 夏尔呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's over there now. Where's Sherl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏尔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 他在洗澡 我估计他一会就出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, he's just having a bath. I'm sure he'll be out in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他洗澡哪里有那么快!  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, like he ever is!  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 还有地方容我进去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning. Room for a little one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.63,0:19:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我只是有个猜想 不过你可能有几个问题要问?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's just a guess, but you've probably got some questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 一两个 差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one or two. Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.95,0:19:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有女朋友了?  - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a girlfriend?  - Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在来说麦努森 他就像一条鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Magnussen. Magnussen is like a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一能够形容他的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way I can describe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去伦敦海洋馆里看过鲨鱼吗 约翰? 紧靠着玻璃那样看?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever been to the shark tank at the London Aquarium, John? Stood up close to the glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:20:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些漂浮着的毫无表情的脸 空洞的眼睛 他就是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those floating, flat faces, those dead eyes. That's what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和杀人犯 精神病患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dealt with murderers, psychopaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖分子和连环杀手都交过手\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrorists, serial killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们中没有任何一个人能像麦努森那样让我感到恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them can turn my stomach like Charles Augustus Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你有女朋友了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有女朋友了?  - 什么? 是啊 是啊 我和珍宁约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a girlfriend?  - What? Yes, yes, I'm going out with Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我以为我做得很明显了  - 是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought that was fairly obvious.  - Yes. Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你... 你谈恋爱了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... You... You are in a relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和珍宁?  - 嗯 是啊 我和珍宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and Janine?  - Hmm. Yes, me and Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.99,0:20:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能详细说说吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to elaborate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 我们关系很好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're in a good place. It's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 非常稳定  - 你从书上看来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- very affirming.  - You got that from a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都是从书上看来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone got that from a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 你们两个要乖乖的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, you two bad boys. Behave yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏尔 你得告诉我你昨天晚上去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Sherl, you're going to have to tell me where you were last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.55,0:20:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 工作  - 工作? 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Working.  - Working? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.47,0:20:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我知道你是什么样的人吧 记得吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who really knows what you're like, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可别说出去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't you go letting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可没准 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I might just, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没告诉过玛丽这件事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told Mary about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有点想给她个惊喜  - 是啊 我觉得这很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I kind of wanted to surprise her.  - Yeah, I think you probably will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们应该很快就会请你们俩来吃晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we should have you two over for dinner, really soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 不过得去我那 而不是在这个垃圾堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. My place though, not the scuzz-dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚餐 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 见到你真开心  - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd better dash. It was brilliant to see you.  - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你过得开心 晚点打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a lovely day. Call me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该会打给你 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I might do. I might call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我遇到更帅的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I meet someone prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破个案子吧 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solve me a crime, Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道麦努森有家报社\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Magnussen as a newspaper owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他的身份远不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he is so much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他运用他的权力和财富去获取信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}He uses his power and wealth to gain information.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得到的信息越多 他的财富和权力也会随之增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more he acquires, the greater his wealth and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:22:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫不夸张地说 他知道西方世界每个重要人物的致命弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not exaggerating when I say that he knows the critical pressure point on every person of note
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.51,0:22:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至可能不只是西方世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}or influence in the whole of the Western World and probably beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是勒索界的拿破仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the Napoleon of blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还为那些不为人知的秘密建了一所不可攻破的堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has created an unassailable architecture of forbidden knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its name...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿普尔多尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Appledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 晚餐?  - 不好意思 什么晚餐?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dinner?  - Sorry, what dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和玛丽来吃晚餐...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Mary coming for dinner with...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.79,0:22:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有红酒...\N{\fnArial\fs30}wine and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆好座次的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗? 我刚刚告诉你整个西方世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously? I have just told you that the Western World is run
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都被这所房子控制着 而你想跟我说晚餐的事?  - 好吧 说房子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from this house and you want to talk about dinner?  - Fine. Talk about the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里收藏着世界上最敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the greatest repository of sensitive and dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最危险的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}information anywhere in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是丑闻和秘密的亚历山大图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Alexandrian Library of secrets and scandals
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且没有任何资料是存在电脑里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none of it is on a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.83,0:22:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很聪明 因为电脑可以被攻破\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smart. Computers can be hacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.75,0:22:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的信息都是纸质版 藏在这个房子的底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all on hard copy, in vaults, underneath that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.55,0:22:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要它还存在 你认识的任何人的隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as long as it is, the personal freedom of anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是无稽之谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've ever met is a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.03,0:22:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门铃响了 你们听不见吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the doorbell. Couldn't you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:23:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是冰箱坏了 它一直响着  - 哦 可不是这个问题 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's in the fridge. It kept ringing.  - Oh, that's not a fault, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.99,0:23:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在敲门?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.59,0:23:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生说你们可以上楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes said you can go right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(玛莎·路易斯·哈德森  房东太太)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(弱点: 大麻)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能稍等一下吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我... 好吧 我可能应该告诉你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I... Right. I should probably tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.19,0:23:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就想说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.23,0:23:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不代表我对你不友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean I'm not pleased to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以为这个人作证 他是个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can vouch for this man. He is a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.51,0:23:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你知道我是谁 那你也应该知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know who I am, then you know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.35,0:23:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗 麦努森先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you, Mr Magnussen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为我们要在你的办公室见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understood we were meeting at your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:23:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是我的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.91,0:24:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(约翰·哈米什·华生  驻阿富汗老兵 军医)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(弱点: 哈莉·华生   玛丽·摩斯坦)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.67,0:24:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 现在是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.71,0:24:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森先生 我受伊丽莎白·斯莫尔伍德女士的委托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Magnussen, I have been asked to intercede with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.59,0:24:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与您进行协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Lady Elizabeth Smallwood
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.67,0:24:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他丈夫书信的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the matter of her husband's letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前段时间你用这些信向她施压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some time ago you put pressure on her concerning those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.95,0:24:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她希望要回这些信\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would like those letters back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 这些信对你没有任何作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, the letters no longer have any practical use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.43,0:24:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.95,0:24:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So with that in mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.95,0:24:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说错什么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 没 我在浏览\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I was reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.91,0:24:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's rather a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.35,0:24:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红胡子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.87,0:24:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 你刚才在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry, you were probably talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.55,0:24:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... \N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.23,0:25:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在解释我是受托于...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to explain that I have been asked to act on behalf of...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.11,0:25:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洗手间在哪儿?  - 厨房旁边 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bathroom?  - Along from the kitchen, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我是来协商拿回那些信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I've been asked to negotiate the return of those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.19,0:25:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白你对敏感文件不会备份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware you do not make copies of sensitive documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.23,0:25:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟公寓其它地方一样吗?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it like the rest of the flat?  - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浴室?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.63,0:25:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 先生  - 那我还是不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir.  - Maybe not then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.51,0:25:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,允许我做其中的协调人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I acceptable to you as an intermediary?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.43,0:25:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·斯莫尔伍德女士...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Elizabeth Smallwood...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森先生 我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Magnussen, am I acceptable to you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做中间的协调人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an intermediary?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.55,0:25:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是有骨气的英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's English with a spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.15,0:25:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英国人最好的一点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing about the English...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你们很听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're so domesticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.47,0:25:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在那一个劲地道歉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All standing around, apologising...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.83,0:25:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卑微地低着头\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping your little heads down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以为所欲为 没人可以阻拦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do what you like here. No-one's ever going to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.51,0:26:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群食草动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nation of herbivores.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的利益集团遍布全世界...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have interests all over the world but...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一切都起源于英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything starts in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.47,0:26:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在这里奏效...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it works here...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.31,0:26:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就到真正的国家去试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try it in a real country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.59,0:26:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大英帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The United Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.95,0:26:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西方世界的培养皿\N{\fnArial\fs30}petri dish to the Western World.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.51,0:26:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉伊丽莎白女士 我可能会用到这些信...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Lady Elizabeth I might need those letters so...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm keeping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.95,0:26:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.95,0:26:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.15,0:26:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写得很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.71,0:26:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发现他做了一件非常极品的事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice the one extraordinary thing he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.67,0:27:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想忘都难 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a moment that kind of stuck in the mind, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.43,0:27:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他给我们看到了那些信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. When he showed us the letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.15,0:27:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 他把信逮到了伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So, he's brought the letters to London,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.47,0:27:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他说什么 他已经准备要完成一笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}so no matter what he says, he's ready to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.63,0:27:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 麦努森只会在那人的弱点上交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Magnussen only makes a deal once he's established a person's weaknesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是他说的压制点 所以他坚信\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pressure point, he calls it. So, clearly he believes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.87,0:27:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个瘾君子 不足为惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a drug addict and no serious threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.79,0:27:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有当然 他今晚七点到十点会和市场部的主管吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course, because he's in town tonight, the letters will be in his safe in his London office
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.99,0:27:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些信就会留在办公室的保险箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he's out to dinner with the Marketing Group of GB from seven till ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.19,0:27:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道他的行程?  - 我就是知道 今晚见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know his schedule?  - Because I do. I'll see you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.07,0:27:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去买点东西  - 今晚干吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got some shopping to do.  - What's tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.31,0:27:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会短信告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll text instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.55,0:27:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会发短信告诉你我有没有空  - 你有空 我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'll text you if I'm available.  - You are, I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.15,0:27:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别带枪  - 我为什么要带枪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't bring a gun.  - Why would I bring a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.91,0:27:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也别带刀子或者轮胎撬杆 别把别人的胳膊扭伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a knife or a tyre lever. Probably best not to do any arm-spraining,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 晚上再看情况  - 你就那么肯定我会跟去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but we'll see how the night goes.  - Are you just assuming I'm coming along?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.15,0:27:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候出出门了 约翰 自从结婚后你长了七磅肉 光骑车是减不下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time you got out of the house, John. You've put on 7lbs since you married and the cycling isn't doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.11,0:27:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是四磅  - 玛丽和我都觉得是七磅 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's actually 4lbs.  - Mary and I think seven. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.27,0:28:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特大新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And breaking news now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.95,0:28:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国会议员约翰·嘉文今天因贪污被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Garvie MP has been arrested today on charges of corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这引起一系列调查...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This follows an investigation...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.79,0:28:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森的办公室在顶楼 就在他私人公寓下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen's office is on the top floor, just below his private flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.03,0:28:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中间有十四层安保措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 14 layers of security between us and him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中两个在英国不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}two of which aren't even legal in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.27,0:28:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想知道我们怎么闯进去吗?  - 我们要闯进去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want to know how we're going to break in?  - Is that what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.55,0:28:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森的私人电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen's private lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.63,0:28:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直通他的房间和办公室 只有他能使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes straight to his penthouse and office. Only he uses it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.19,0:28:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也只有他有门禁卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only his keycard calls the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.39,0:28:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果其他人想要进入 会自动触发安保\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone else even tries, security is automatically informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.07,0:28:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这栋楼普通的卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard keycard for the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天搞来的 最多把我们送到餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicked it yesterday. Only gets us as far as the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这了 如果我用这张卡刷电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go then. If I was to use this card on that lift now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.87,0:29:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 会发生什么?  - 警报会响起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what happens?  - Well, the alarms would go off
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你会被保安拖走  - 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and you'd be dragged away by security.  - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拖进小黑屋暴打一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get taken to a small room somewhere and your head kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.19,0:29:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那么有画面感?  - 消磨时间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we really need so much colour?  - It passes the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.71,0:29:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果我这样...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.83,0:29:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手机和门禁卡放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you press a keycard against your mobile phone for long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.67,0:29:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就会被消磁 卡就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it corrupts the magnetic strip. The card stops working.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.23,0:29:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是常识 不要把手机和磁卡放一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a common problem. Never put your keycard with your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我用这张卡会怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if I use the card now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.75,0:29:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It still doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不会显示为错卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't read as the wrong card now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会显示卡被损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It registers as corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.95,0:29:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是卡坏了 他们怎么确定不是麦努森呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's corrupted, how do they know it's not Magnussen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.07,0:29:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们会冒险拖走他?  - 可能不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would they risk dragging him off?  - Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.19,0:29:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么他们会怎么办? 会怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do they do? What do they have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.51,0:29:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核实是不是他本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check if it's him or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.71,0:29:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在门右侧的视线高度有个摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a camera at eye height to the right of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用卡人的实时录像会直接传到\N{\fnArial\fs30}A live picture of the card user is relayed directly
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.19,0:29:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森的私人秘书那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Magnussen's personal staff in his office,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是唯一能确认身份的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only people trusted to make a positive ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.15,0:30:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个点 应该是他的私人助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this hour, almost certainly his PA.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.11,0:30:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does that help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠人为失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human error.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.07,0:30:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你长得可不像麦努森?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realise you don't exactly look like Magnussen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是大优势呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which in this case is a considerable advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.23,0:30:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 你真是疯了 你来干吗?!  - 等一下 那不是...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, you complete loon. What are you doing?!  - Hang on, was that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 珍宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.55,0:30:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.67,0:30:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了 你知道我不能放你进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. You know I can't. Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.95,0:30:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我在外面做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me do it out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.35,0:30:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这么多人面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what in front of everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.71,0:31:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看 只要是人 都有弱点  - 那是珍宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see, as long as there's people, there's always a weak spot.  - That was Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.11,0:31:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然就是她 她是麦努森的私人助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course it was. She's Magnussen's PA.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.11,0:31:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这才是关键所在  - 你因为要闯进一间办公室而订婚了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the whole point.  - Did you just get engaged to break into an office?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.59,0:31:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊 在你婚礼上认识的 有你的功劳  - 天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Stroke of luck meeting her at your wedding. You can take some of the credit.  - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 她是爱你的  - 是啊 正如我所说 人为失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, she loves you.  - Yes. Like I said, human error.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要怎么办?  - 显然不可能娶她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you going to do?  - Well, not actually marry her, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.39,0:31:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然也不能太过分  - 那你打算怎么告诉她?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's only so far you can go.  - So, what will you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉她我是为了闯进他老板的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll tell her that our entire relationship was a ruse
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才跟她在一起的 我想她会自己结束吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break into her boss's office. I imagine she'll want to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.51,0:31:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你才是女人方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing me at that point, but you're the expert on women.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.75,0:31:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.23,0:31:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚求过婚 这也太不礼貌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bit rude. I just proposed to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.91,0:31:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.23,0:31:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她高兴得晕过去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she faint?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人真的会这样吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they really do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.15,0:31:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头被打伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blow to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.19,0:31:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还有呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍宁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janine?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:32:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.35,0:32:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他需要帮助吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有犯罪前科 白人主义者的纹身 谁管他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-con. White supremacist by the tattoos, so who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.19,0:32:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照顾好珍宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick with Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.75,0:32:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍宁 听见我说话了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janine, focus on my voice. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.75,0:32:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(温度: 35°C)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.87,0:32:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they must still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.23,0:32:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森也在 他椅子还是热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is Magnussen. His seat's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.11,0:32:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该在晚餐 但他现在在楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be at dinner, but he's still in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.07,0:32:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在楼上  - 我们应该报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Upstairs.  - We should call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正入室抢劫呢? 在这方面你真是没天赋啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}During our own burglary? You're really not a natural at this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.95,0:32:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Sssh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有香水 但不是简妮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfume and not Janine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.79,0:32:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月色 在哪闻过?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire de la Lune. Why do I know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.79,0:32:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛丽就用那个  - 不 不是玛丽 另有其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary wears it.  - No, not Mary. Somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.55,0:32:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.79,0:33:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丈夫会怎么想?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would your husband think?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可爱可敬的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lovely husband, upright and honourable,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.51,0:33:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么绅士 他现在会对你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}so English. What would he say to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.79,0:33:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.87,0:33:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做这些是为了让他不知道真相?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing this to protect him from the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.71,0:33:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是他想要的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is this the protection he would want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.27,0:33:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外 如果你想要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additionally, if you're going to commit murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.39,0:33:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你换一种香水 斯莫尔伍德女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might consider changing your perfume, Lady Smallwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.99,0:33:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个... 不是斯莫尔伍德女士 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's... not Lady Smallwood, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.75,0:33:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(骗子)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰跟你一起来了吗?  - 他 嗯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is John with you?  - He's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.39,0:33:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰在这吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is John here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.87,0:34:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.47,0:34:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在打算怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.31,0:34:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我们俩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill us both?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.03,0:34:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 不管他手中有你的任何把柄 我会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, whatever he's got on you, let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你再敢上前一步 我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock, if you take one more step, I swear I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.95,0:34:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 华生太太...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mrs Watson...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.43,0:34:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.07,0:34:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.47,0:34:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.47,0:34:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.71,0:34:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不像在电影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like it is in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.03,0:34:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有血花四溅 人也不会向后飞去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a great big spurt of blood and you go flying backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲击力不会扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}The impact isn't spread over a wide area.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.99,0:34:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是集中于一点 基本没有能量传递\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tightly focused so there's little or no energy transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.83,0:34:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站着不动 子弹就射穿了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay still and the bullet pushes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.75,0:35:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上就死定了 你得集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost certainly going to die, so we need to focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.19,0:35:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了 "专心!"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Focus!"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.23,0:35:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个记忆宫殿很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all well and clever having a mind palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.23,0:35:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你只有三秒钟清醒的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've only three seconds of consciousness left to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以快想 致死的原因是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, come on. What's going to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 失血过多  - 是的 所以只有一个关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blood loss.  - Exactly. So, it's all about one thing now
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.39,0:35:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往前倒还是往后倒?\N{\fnArial\fs30}forwards or backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.67,0:35:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得决定好你往哪里倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to decide which way you're going to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.03,0:35:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一个洞还是两个?  - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One hole or two?  - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.19,0:35:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹还在你体内吗? 还是射穿了?这取决于是什么枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the bullet still inside you? Or is there an exit wound? It'll depend on the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.67,0:35:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想是这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.87,0:35:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 夏洛克 这跟枪无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake, Sherlock. It doesn't matter about the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.35,0:35:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.11,0:35:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是这么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.63,0:35:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.23,0:35:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a very stupid little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.71,0:35:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸妈会很生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy and Daddy are very cross
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.91,0:35:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这跟枪无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it doesn't matter about the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.35,0:35:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.63,0:35:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚进房间就看了整个屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the whole room when you entered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.83,0:36:01.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你被谋杀前 你背后是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was directly behind you when you were murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.43,0:36:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've not been murdered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.67,0:36:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极有可能 小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balance of probability, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.87,0:36:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果子弹穿过了你 你会听见什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the bullet had passed through you, what would you have heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.43,0:36:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻璃碎掉的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mirror shattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.87,0:36:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没听到 所以...?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't. Therefore...?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹还在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet's still inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.03,0:36:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要往后倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we need to take him down backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意 夏洛克 你需要向后倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree. Sherlock, you need to fall on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.03,0:36:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在子弹就像瓶塞一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now the bullet is the cork in a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.27,0:36:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本身可以止住大部分血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet itself is blocking most of the blood flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.83,0:36:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是任何挤压压力都会使它错位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But any pressure or impact on the entrance wound could dislodge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.19,0:36:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 背部着地 重力也能止血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, on your back, gravity's working for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.71,0:36:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.03,0:36:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.27,0:36:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?! 发生什么事了?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?! What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.23,0:37:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会进入休克 这是下一个致死的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going into shock. It's the next thing that's going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.27,0:37:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我该早呢么做?  - 很明显 别休克就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I do?  - Don't go into shock, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.23,0:37:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个可笑的记忆宫殿里肯定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be something in this ridiculous memory palace of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.39,0:37:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你冷静下来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can calm you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.55,0:37:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.87,0:37:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东风神要来了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The East Wind is coming, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.99,0:37:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要来抓你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.95,0:37:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好呀 红胡子 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Redbeard. Here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.23,0:37:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 来我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.63,0:37:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来 是我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's me. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.67,0:37:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.87,0:37:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好孩子 真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. Clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.79,0:37:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.27,0:37:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好呀 红胡子 他们也要杀了我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Redbeard. They're putting me down too now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.43,0:37:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真没劲 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no fun, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.95,0:37:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克过去了 你会感觉到疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was shock. You're going to feel the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.47,0:37:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身上开了个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a hole ripped through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.71,0:38:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,严重内出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Massive internal bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.91,0:38:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得控制疼痛感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to control the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.11,0:38:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制 控制 控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control. Control. Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.19,0:38:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.39,0:38:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从来感觉不到疼痛 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never felt pain, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会感觉不到的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you never feel pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.35,0:38:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是能感觉到 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always feel it, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.51,0:38:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不必惧怕它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't have to fear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼痛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心碎...\N{\fnArial\fs30}heartbreak...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.11,0:38:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.51,0:38:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡...\N{\fnArial\fs30}death...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.03,0:38:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.75,0:38:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.15,0:39:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克! 夏洛克 能听到我说话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock! Sherlock. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.11,0:39:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.59,0:39:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.83,0:39:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.27,0:39:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁开的枪?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who shot him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.07,0:39:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应急中心 您需要什么服务?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency. Which service do you require?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.31,0:39:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 下雨了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's raining ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.51,0:39:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 大雨了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's pouring ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.51,0:39:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 夏洛克无聊了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Sherlock is boring ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.75,0:39:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我笑了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm laughing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.79,0:39:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我哭了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm crying ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.39,0:39:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 夏洛克要死了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Sherlock is dying ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.19,0:39:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing you. Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.23,0:39:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 夏洛克 乖乖死掉 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sherlock. Just die, why can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.27,0:39:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小小推一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}One little push
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.55,0:39:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就死透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and off you pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会喜欢死去的感觉的 夏洛克 没人会再烦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to love being dead, Sherlock. No-one ever bothers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈德森太太会哭...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson will cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.71,0:40:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈会哭...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Mummy and Daddy will cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.03,0:40:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女人会哭 约翰会哭得特别伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the woman will cry and John will cry buckets and buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.27,0:40:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最担心的就是他了 他那个老婆!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him that I worry about the most. That wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.35,0:40:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让他失望了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're letting him down, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.59,0:40:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·华生肯定有危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson is definitely in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.39,0:40:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没让你好受点 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're not getting better, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.43,0:40:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为我说的话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it something I said, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.63,0:40:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.39,0:41:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛丽  - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mary.  - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.59,0:41:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚刚才醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's only bloody woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.31,0:41:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's pulled through.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.43,0:41:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的?  - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.45,0:41:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的?  - 你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously?  - You...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.67,0:41:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华生太太 你有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Watson, you're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.43,0:41:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的? 怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他醒过来说的第一个词...\N{\fnArial\fs30}His first word when he woke up...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.79,0:41:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是"玛丽"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mary."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.07,0:42:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.63,0:42:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.23,0:42:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell John.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.91,0:42:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.23,0:42:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个坏姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad, bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.99,0:42:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说你不会告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me you're not going to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.23,0:42:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要买一间小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm buying a cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.23,0:42:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我靠你赚了很多钱 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made a lot of money out of you, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.59,0:42:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有比一边报复一边赚钱更爽的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing hits the spot like revenge with profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没把这些告诉麦努森吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't give those stories to Magnussen, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.43,0:42:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然没有 是他的竞争对手 他可不屑这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. One of his rivals. He was spitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.63,0:43:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.23,0:43:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 你真是个阴险狡诈 没心没肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes, you are a back-stabbing, heartless,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满嘴谎言的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}manipulative bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.47,0:43:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实证明 你是个贪婪 投机取巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, as it turns out, are a grasping, opportunistic,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.63,0:43:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渴望出名的小报婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}publicity-hungry, tabloid whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.11,0:43:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们扯平了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're good then?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.59,0:43:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.63,0:43:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小屋在哪儿?  - 苏塞克斯当斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the cottage?  - Sussex Downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.39,0:43:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 挺好  - 很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice.  - It's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.31,0:43:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有蜂巢 但我打算清理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's beehives, but I'm getting rid of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.71,0:43:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口很疼 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it hurts, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.03,0:43:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好还是接着注射吗啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably want to restart your morphine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.11,0:43:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我摆弄了一下开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have fiddled with the taps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.75,0:43:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你需要报复多少才能满足?  - 偶尔补充一下就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much more revenge are you going to need?  - Just the occasional top-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.27,0:43:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方对你来说还真是梦想成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream come true for you, this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.43,0:43:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真的给你注射毒品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They actually attach the drugs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.63,0:43:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对工作不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good for working.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.27,0:43:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得停工一段时间了 夏尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be working for a while, Sherl.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.83,0:43:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.75,0:43:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一骗再骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.07,0:43:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我利用了我们对彼此的好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I exploited the fact of our connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.87,0:43:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候?\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.67,0:43:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕说一次实话也就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once would have been nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.23,0:43:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本打算结婚的时候再说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting till we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.59,0:43:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们永远结不了婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was never going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.07,0:44:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.55,0:44:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不应该让你一直说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to keep you talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.63,0:44:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我要在一台的节目接受采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also, I have an interview with The One Show
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.27,0:44:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没准备好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I haven't made it up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.99,0:44:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一句...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.39,0:44:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不应该骗我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shouldn't have lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.91,0:44:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你为人如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what kind of man you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.39,0:44:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们本可以做朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we could have been friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.11,0:44:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会代你向约翰和玛丽问好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give your love to John and Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.07,0:44:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.59,0:44:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell John.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.95,0:44:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·华生...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Watson...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.27,0:44:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.55,0:45:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.19,0:45:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你能听懂多少他说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much sense you'll get out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.71,0:45:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被注射了药物 说话很含糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's drugged up, so he's pretty much babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会允许你在医院里打电话的 懂吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they won't let you use that in here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.11,0:45:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会打电话 只是想拍段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not going to use the phone. I just want to take a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.55,0:45:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.39,0:45:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会去哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where would he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.95,0:45:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Christ knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.63,0:45:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要在伦敦找夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try finding Sherlock in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.03,0:45:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有三个已知的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got three known bolt-holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议会山 康顿水门和达格玛法院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parliament Hill, Camden Lock and Dagmar Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.43,0:45:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五个已知的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five known bolt holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.07,0:45:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基尤皇家植物园的盲人温室\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the blind greenhouse in Kew Gardens
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.35,0:45:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汉普斯特得公墓的墓室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the leaning tomb in Hampstead Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.43,0:45:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the spare bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.19,0:45:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都同意他需要空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed he needs the space.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.11,0:46:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大本钟钟面的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the clock face of Big Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.59,0:46:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他大概是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he was probably joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.23,0:46:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我觉得是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.51,0:46:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦斯特花园 这是他首选的避难所 非常机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leinster Gardens. It's his number one bolt hole. Top, top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.71,0:46:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有天晚上跟踪他的时候才知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only knows about it cos he stalked him one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.95,0:46:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟着!  - 是跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Followed!  - Followed, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.83,0:46:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道是谁开的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew who shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.79,0:46:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口在正面 所以他当时面对着凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet wound was here, so he was facing whoever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.67,0:46:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我们? 因为他正在独自追查凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why not tell us? Because he's tracking them down himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.43,0:46:28.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或是在保护他们  - 保护凶手 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or protecting them.  - Protecting the shooter, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.75,0:46:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是在保护某人 但他为什么在乎?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, protecting someone then. But why would he care?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.23,0:46:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是夏洛克 有谁是他想保护的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Sherlock. Who would he bother protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.35,0:46:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事情就打我电话 不要慢着我 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me if you hear anything. Don't hold out on me, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.27,0:46:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 打给我 好吗?  - 好 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me, OK?  - Yeah. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 晚安  - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night then.  - Bye then.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.11,0:46:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 想喝杯茶吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, need a cuppa?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.79,0:46:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈德森太太 夏洛克怎么就认为我会搬回来呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, why does Sherlock think that I'll be moving back in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.75,0:46:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 他把你的椅子放回去了 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, he's put your chair back again, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.59,0:46:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错 看上去更好看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice. It looks much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.91,0:47:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 怎么了? 跟我说说 约翰?\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, what's wrong? Tell me. John?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.87,0:47:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的电话 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your phone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.19,0:47:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是夏洛克 约翰 是夏洛克打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sherlock, John. Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.63,0:47:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 你得接电话!\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you have to answer it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.19,0:47:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给点零钱吧 女士  - 不行  - 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spare any change, love?  - No.  - Oh, come on, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.31,0:47:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别和其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be like all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.91,0:47:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,规矩一 想找夏洛克·福尔摩斯 必须是他先找上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule one of looking for Sherlock Holmes, he finds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.23,0:47:32.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在为夏洛克工作了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're working for Sherlock now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 至少我不会在街上乱逛了 对吧?  - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keeps me off the streets, doesn't it?  - Well... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.99,0:47:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿?  - 你看不到我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you?  - Can't you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.43,0:47:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.39,0:47:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦斯特花园的谎言 就在你眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lie, the lie of Leinster Gardens, hidden in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.23,0:47:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别人看不见 在这儿长住的人们却总是看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly anyone notices. People live here for years and never see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.31,0:47:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果我猜的没错 你一分钟就能发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you are what I think you are, it will take you less than a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.67,0:48:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子 玛丽 看看房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The houses, Mary. Look at the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.23,0:48:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我会来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know I'd come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.31,0:48:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会去和别人忽视的人谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd talk to the people no-one else would bother with.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.15,0:48:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为那只是小聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, I thought I was being clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.35,0:48:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直很聪明 玛丽 我靠的就是这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always clever, Mary, I was relying on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.23,0:48:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下线索 让你寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I planted the information for you to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.67,0:48:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.87,0:48:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只用了30秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.71,0:48:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有门把手 没有信箱 窗户被刷上了油漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No door knobs, no letterbox. Painted windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦斯特花园23号和24号\N{\fnArial\fs30}23 and 24 Leinster Gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.35,0:48:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空置的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empty houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.43,0:48:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了给伦敦地下铁腾地方 为老式蒸汽火车造通风口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were demolished years ago to make way for the London Underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.43,0:48:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子很久前就被拆毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a vent for the old steam trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.31,0:48:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有房子最靠前的部分保留了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the very front section of the house remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个假象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.35,0:48:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有让你想到谁 玛丽?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind you of anyone, Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.67,0:48:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假象?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A facade?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.51,0:48:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我总是忍不住弄出点戏剧效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I never could resist a touch of drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.67,0:48:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进吧 里面有点窄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do come in. It's a little cramped.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.31,0:48:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这地方的主人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you own this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.91,0:48:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和克拉伦斯府的人大牌赢来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, I won it in a card game with the Clarence House Cannibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.87,0:49:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差点害我失去了肾 但幸运的是 我拿到了同花顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly cost me my kidneys, but fortunately I had a straight flush.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.99,0:49:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女人赌劲十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a gambler, that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.27,0:49:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.59,0:49:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽·摩斯坦夭折 死于1972年10月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary Morstan was stillborn in October 1972.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.31,0:49:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的墓碑在奇斯威克公墓 五年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her gravestone is in Chiswick cemetery, where five years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.19,0:49:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得到了她的名字和生日 之后便用她的身份生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you acquired her name and date of birth, and thereafter her identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.35,0:49:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你在那之前没有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you don't have friends from before that date.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.19,0:49:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得好好想想你那边的客人 玛丽 看上去有点少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to work on your half of the church, Mary. Looking a bit thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.87,0:49:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤儿没什么其它东西 我也就只有这些朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, orphan's lot. Friends, that's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.43,0:49:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对某些人来说是非常老旧的手段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old enough technique, known to the kinds of people
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.35,0:49:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能一眼看出跳步码...\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could recognise a skip code on sight...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.11,0:49:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始我以为是圣经里的内容 垃圾广告 但不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first I thought it was just a Bible thing, spam, but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.67,0:49:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是跳步码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a skip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.43,0:49:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有超强的记忆能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have extraordinarily retentive memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.99,0:49:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会记不得哪个房间? 你过目不忘啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you not remember which room? You remember everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.63,0:49:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得清理内存!  - 是207\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to delete something!  - 207.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.07,0:50:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were very slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.15,0:50:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的枪法如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good a shot are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.55,0:50:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有多想知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How badly do you want to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.11,0:50:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我死在这里 他们就会发现我的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I die here, my body would be found in a building
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.43,0:50:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一栋外墙有你照片的楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your face projected on the front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.15,0:50:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是苏格兰场的人都能查出问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Scotland Yard could get somewhere with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.75,0:50:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道你的枪法有多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.83,0:50:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.35,0:50:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生的妻子现在肯定有点无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor's wife must be a little bit bored by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.07,0:50:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能看看吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.95,0:50:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个仿制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, it's a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.23,0:50:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这把戏还真是明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose that was a fairly obvious trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.87,0:50:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当时只隔了六步\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, over a distance of six feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.03,0:51:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却没能一枪杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you failed to make a kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.71,0:51:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让我躺进了医院 却没能杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to hospitalise me, not enough to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.91,0:51:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是失手 是故意为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a miss, that was surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.27,0:51:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我接下这案子了  - 什么案子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take the case.  - What case?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.31,0:51:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的案子 你为什么不一开始就冲我来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours. Why didn't you come to me in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.91,0:51:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不能让约翰知道我骗了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because John can't ever know that I lied to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.67,0:51:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会让他伤心 我就永远失去他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would break him and I would lose him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.31,0:51:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我不会让这种事情发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sherlock, I will never let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.35,0:51:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了阻止这种事情发生 没有事情是我不会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is nothing in this world I would not do to stop that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.43,0:51:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.15,0:51:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把戏还不够明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that obvious a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.11,0:52:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去和他谈谈 快点把事情解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now talk and sort it out and do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.63,0:52:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 听! 天使在唱歌 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hark! The Herald Angels Sing ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.19,0:52:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 竟然只有两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear God, it's only two o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.07,0:52:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少都已经过了一周的圣诞节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been Christmas Day for at least a week now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.27,0:52:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能只有两点? 我快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can it only be two o'clock? I'm in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.83,0:52:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克 这是你的笔记本电脑吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey, is this your laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.83,0:52:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面的资料决定了自由世界的安全 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon which depends the security of the free world, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.71,0:52:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还把土豆放在了上面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've got potatoes on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.47,0:52:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真有那么重要 你就不应该随便放\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't leave it lying around if it's so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.99,0:52:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这么做? 我们从不庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we doing this? We never do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.27,0:52:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为夏洛克出院回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here because Sherlock is home from hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are all very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.15,0:52:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也高兴吗? 我怎么不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I happy too? I haven't checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.79,0:52:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礼貌点 迈克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behave, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.03,0:52:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我起的名字叫迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft is the name you gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.71,0:52:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你最好坚持一直这么叫下去  - 福尔摩斯夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you could possibly struggle all the way to the end.  - Mrs Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.63,0:52:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的 我不知道你为什么会来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, dear. I'm not absolutely sure why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.03,0:53:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我邀请他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invited him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.43,0:53:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是他的门徒 福尔摩斯夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm his protege, Mrs Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.15,0:53:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死后 我会得到他的一切 还有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he dies, I get all his stuff and his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.23,0:53:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不对  - 好吧 我就是帮点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - Oh, well, I help out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.75,0:53:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话靠谱些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.83,0:53:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他被谋杀什么的了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does get murdered or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.67,0:53:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还是闭嘴好了  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probably stop talking now.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.75,0:53:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能带朋友来真是太好了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely when you bring your friends round!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.87,0:53:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要欺负他了 有人对我儿子开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, you. Somebody's put a bullet in my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.03,0:53:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果让我知道是谁 我肯定就会发狂去报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ever find out who, I shall turn absolutely monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.67,0:53:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是给玛丽的 我一会儿就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was for Mary. I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.47,0:53:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(倒计时: 7分37秒)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.99,0:53:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 你在这儿呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Mary. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.99,0:53:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝杯茶 如果老头子开始哼哼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cup of tea. If Father starts making little humming noises,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.35,0:53:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就给他点柴火 通常很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}just give him a little poke. That usually does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.43,0:53:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你写的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you write this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.51,0:53:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻的时候随便写的 你就不该看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that silly old thing, you mustn't read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.63,0:53:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在看来 数学肯定很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathematics must seem terribly fatuous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.79,0:53:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别哼哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No humming, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.47,0:53:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子虽然总是东拉西扯 但却是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete flake, my wife, but happens to be a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.51,0:53:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是个数学家?\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a mathematician?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.07,0:54:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了孩子都放弃了 我从来都不敢和她吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave it all up for children. I could never bear to argue with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.71,0:54:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我有点笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm something of a moron myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.43,0:54:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她... 性感得难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's... unbelievably hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.19,0:54:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 你是唯一正常的 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God, you're the sane one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.15,0:54:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.91,0:54:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry, I just, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.99,0:54:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们需要谈谈吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you two need a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.47,0:54:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能否回避一下?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.35,0:54:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以 我去看看能不能帮忙...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, course not. I'll go and see if I can help with...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.31,0:54:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便帮点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}something or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.23,0:54:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个 没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two. They all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.23,0:54:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道 婚姻总有起落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, they've had their ups and downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.99,0:54:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在回贝克街吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baker Street, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.79,0:55:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 玛丽...\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.87,0:55:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 天啊 你看上去糟透了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock, oh, good gracious, you look terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.19,0:55:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你的厨房帮我拿些吗啡来 我的吃完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me some morphine from your kitchen, I've run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.59,0:55:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没有吗啡  - 那你到底想说什么?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have any morphine.  - Then what exactly is the point of you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.75,0:55:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.07,0:55:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华生夫妇要进行一次家庭谈话 我希望能快点 因为还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Watsons are about to have a domestic and fairly quickly I hope, because we've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.07,0:55:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我有个更好的问题...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I have a better question...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.43,0:55:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我遇到过的人都是疯子吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}is everyone I have ever met a psychopath?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.63,0:55:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.03,0:55:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很好 我们回答了这个问题 现在...  - 闭嘴!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good that we've settled that. Now we...  - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.03,0:55:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说话 因为这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay shut up, because this is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.75,0:55:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.79,0:55:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没说这很好笑  - 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't say it was funny.  - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了什么? 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I ever done? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要毁了我整个人生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life, to deserve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.15,0:55:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.71,0:55:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我说过了 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, I've told you, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:56:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我说真的... 是所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean it... seriously, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所做的一切 都是既成事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've ever done, is what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.75,0:56:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你再说一个字 我就揍晕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, one more word and you will not need morphine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.15,0:56:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是去过战场的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a doctor who went to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个不能安安分分住在郊区的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man who couldn't stay in the suburbs for more than a month
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.03,0:56:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总会去袭击贼窝 揍瘾君子一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}without storming a crack den, beating up a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.43,0:56:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好的朋友是个反社会者 为了不嗑药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best friend is a sociopath, who solves crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.95,0:56:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他改行破案 顺便说一句 那就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an alternative to getting high. That's me, by the way, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.59,0:56:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕是房东太太也曾经领导过一个贩毒集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the landlady used to run a drug cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.51,0:56:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我丈夫的 我只是负责打字\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my husband's cartel. I was just typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.51,0:56:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还跳艳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And exotic dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.15,0:56:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 如果你看YouTube...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes, if you've been YouTubing...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 你对某种生活方式上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, you are addicted to a certain lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.31,0:56:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不正常 危险的情况和人总是找上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are abnormally attracted to dangerous situations and people,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.63,0:56:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你发现爱上的女人也符合这个模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}so is it truly such a surprise that the woman you fall in love with
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.51,0:56:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的需要那么惊讶吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}conforms to that pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.15,0:56:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她不应该是那样的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she wasn't supposed to be like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.47,0:56:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为什么是那样的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is she like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.75,0:56:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你选了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you chose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.19,0:57:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么所有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is everything always
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.95,0:57:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的错?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}my fault?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.11,0:57:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心邻居投诉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, neighbours!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.03,0:57:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 听着 冷静下来 回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, listen. Be calm and answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.63,0:57:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.59,0:57:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我撒谎的妻子?  - 不 她是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My lying wife?  - No, what is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.83,0:57:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀着我的孩子 从相遇开始就骗我的女人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the woman who is carrying my child, who has lied to me since the day I met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.35,0:57:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 在这间公寓 在这间房间里就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not in this flat, not in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.71,0:57:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在这里 她是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, right now, what is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.27,0:57:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.15,0:57:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你的方法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.67,0:57:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.83,0:57:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.19,0:57:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.55,0:57:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们都做这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's where they sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.07,0:57:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些来这里讲述故事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who come in here with their stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.71,0:57:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是客户 你现在也是 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the clients, that's all you are now, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.35,0:58:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就应该坐在这里诉说 而我们会坐在这里倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you sit and talk and this is where we sit and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.71,0:58:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后决定要不要接你的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we decide if we want you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.63,0:58:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.51,0:58:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今天终于要交谈了吗? 还真的是圣诞节呢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, are we doing conversation today? It really is Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.63,0:58:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.67,0:58:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的 我们冷战了几个月 现在要谈这个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, months of silence and we're going to do this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.79,0:59:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,AGRA是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.G.R.A., what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.27,0:59:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃... 我名字的缩写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er... my initials.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.55,0:59:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原来的那些事情全在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything about who I was is on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.63,0:59:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你爱我 就不要当面看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you love me, don't read it in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.99,0:59:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.91,0:59:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你看完之后就不会爱我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you won't love me when you've finished
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.11,0:59:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看着这事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't want to see that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.55,0:59:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道多少了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know already?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.99,0:59:35.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据你的技术 以前应该是情报局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}By your skill set, you are, or were, an intelligence agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.31,0:59:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在的口音是英音 但我怀疑你不是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your accent is currently English, but I suspect you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.35,0:59:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在逃避某些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on the run from something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.91,0:59:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用了自己的技术搞失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've used your skills to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.15,0:59:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森知道你的秘密 所以你要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnussen knows your secret, which is why you were going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.07,0:59:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜你和珍宁做朋友 就是为了接近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume you befriended Janine in order to get close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.95,0:59:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得没错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.23,0:59:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你们俩 你们才应该结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at you two, you should have got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.55,0:59:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦努森掌握的那些秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stuff Magnussen has on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.91,0:59:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能我下半辈子就得坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would go to prison for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.71,0:59:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以你就要杀了他?  - 像麦努森这样的人就应该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you were going to kill him?  - People like Magnussen should be killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.79,1:00:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以才会有像我这样的人  - 很好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's why there are people like me.  - Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是做什么的 杀手? 我怎么没发现呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what you were, an assassin? How could I not see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.31,1:00:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.63,1:00:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还娶了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you married me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.07,1:00:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.23,1:00:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就喜欢这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.83,1:00:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 所以麦努森手上一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mary, any documents that Magnussen has
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.15,1:00:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于你的文件 你都想要收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}concerning yourself, you want extracted and returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.55,1:00:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要帮我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.47,1:00:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.75,1:00:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉... 你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry... sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.07,1:00:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我发现你和麦努森的时候...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I happened on you and Magnussen...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.35,1:00:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你便有了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.71,1:00:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说具体点 就是有了目击证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More specifically, you had a witness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.55,1:00:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在打算怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.31,1:00:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我们俩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill both of us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.31,1:01:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解决方法很简单 就是杀了我们俩 然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The solution, of course, was simple. Kill us both and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.47,1:01:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而 当时你感情用事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, sentiment got the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.83,1:01:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用精确计算好的一枪让我失去行动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}One precisely calculated shot to incapacitate me,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.79,1:01:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能换取时间跟我谈判 让我对你的事保持沉默\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the hope that it would buy you more time to negotiate my silence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.91,1:01:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 你不能杀麦努森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you couldn't shoot Magnussen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.59,1:01:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那天晚上我们都潜入了大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the night both of us broke into the building,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.71,1:01:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的丈夫就会变成嫌疑犯 所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}your own husband would become a suspect. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.47,1:01:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得麦努森会利用你在场这件事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}you calculated that Magnussen would use the fact of your involvement...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.11,1:01:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不会告诉警方 这就是他的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than sharing the information with the police, as is his MO.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.03,1:01:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你按照进去的方式离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you left the way you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.75,1:01:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我漏了什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I missed anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.23,1:01:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么救了你的命?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she save your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.83,1:02:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她打电话叫了救护车  - 是我打的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She phoned the ambulance.  - I phoned the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.11,1:02:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她先打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She phoned first.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.07,1:02:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应急中心 您需要什么服务?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency, which service do you require?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.07,1:02:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.99,1:02:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你隔了五分钟才找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't find me for another five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.07,1:02:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果靠你的话 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left to you, I would have died.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.51,1:02:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伦敦救护车的平均到场时间是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The average arrival time for a London ambulance is...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.67,1:02:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人叫了救护车吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did somebody call an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.79,1:02:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八分钟 你们带了吗啡吗? 我在电话里说了要带的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight minutes. Did you bring any morphine? I asked on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.79,1:02:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是发生了枪击案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were told there was a shooting.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.43,1:02:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 上周发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was, last week.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.15,1:02:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得我内出血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe I'm bleeding internally,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.87,1:02:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脉搏很不规律 也许在送医院的路上得给我心肺复苏...\N{\fnArial\fs30}my pulse is very erratic, you may need to restart my heart on the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.03,1:02:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 夏洛克 撑住 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Sherlock. Come on, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.67,1:02:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 约翰 麦努森才是我们要对付的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, John, Magnussen is all that matters now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.27,1:02:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以相信玛丽... 她救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust Mary... she saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.75,1:02:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她向你开了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.35,1:02:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是救我 我保证... 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mixed messages, I grant you that... Argh!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.91,1:02:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克! 夏洛克! 扶着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock! Sherlock! Take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.07,1:02:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 扶好了?  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got him?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.31,1:03:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过内容了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, have you read it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.87,1:03:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可以过来一下吗?  - 不 直接说吧 你看过了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you come here a moment?  - No, tell me, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.35,1:03:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就... 过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.83,1:03:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.67,1:03:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了很久 该怎么和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought long and hard about what I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.07,1:03:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我想好的话 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are prepared words, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.35,1:03:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很用心准备的  - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've chosen these words with care.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.39,1:03:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你过去的错 已经过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problems of your past are your business.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.47,1:03:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的未来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problems of your future...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.91,1:03:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才是我所在乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}are my privilege.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.63,1:03:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I have to say, it's all I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.63,1:03:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没看内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.63,1:04:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都不知道我的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.91,1:04:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢"玛丽·沃特森"这个名字吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is "Mary Watson" good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.79,1:04:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Oh my God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.59,1:04:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很喜欢这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's good enough for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.35,1:04:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这样并不表明我不生你的气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this does not mean that I'm not still basically pissed off with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.67,1:04:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.07,1:04:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是很生气 有时候会发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very pissed off, and it will come out now and then.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.07,1:04:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.43,1:04:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后你可以修剪草坪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can mow the sodding lawn from now on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.71,1:04:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来修剪  - 我来搬运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do mow the lawn.  - I do it loads.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.51,1:04:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才不会干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.75,1:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子名字我来起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I choose the baby's name.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.35,1:04:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那可不行  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not a chance.  - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.63,1:04:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你放弃了和麦努森的交易 我很高兴  - 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm glad you've given up on the Magnussen business.  - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.19,1:04:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我仍然很好奇 他的谜题和你以前遇到的那些不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still curious, though. He's hardly your usual kind of puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么那么恨他?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you hate him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.27,1:04:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他欺凌不同的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he attacks people who are different
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.31,1:04:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他们的秘密威胁他们 你不恨吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and preys on their secrets. Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.91,1:04:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他从来没找过大人物的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never causes too much damage to anyone important.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.59,1:04:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点很明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's far too intelligent for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.51,1:04:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是个商人 有时候对我们还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a businessman, that's all. And occasionally useful to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.91,1:05:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是有点小邪恶 但不是待戮的龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A necessary evil, not a dragon for you to slay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.87,1:05:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戮龙骑士 你就是这么看我的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dragon-slayer. Is that what you think of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.55,1:05:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你自己这么看待自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's what you think of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.75,1:05:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩在抽烟?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you two smoking?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有  - 是迈克罗夫特抽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - It was Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.75,1:05:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个职位邀请 希望你能拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have, by the way, a job offer I should like you to decline.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.27,1:05:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝你的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decline your kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.31,1:05:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会传达你的歉意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall pass on your regrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.71,1:05:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么职位?  - 军情六处想让你回东欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was it?  - MI6. They want to place you back into Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.39,1:05:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要冒着生命危险执行卧底任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}An undercover assignment that would prove fatal to you in,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.79,1:05:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, about six months.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.59,1:05:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么还希望我拒绝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you want me to take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.11,1:05:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想让你去 但是权衡之后 觉得还是留着你更有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tempting, but on balance, you have more utility closer to home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.27,1:05:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有用! 我有什么用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utility! How do I have utility?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.75,1:05:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here be dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.87,1:05:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抽不惯这烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't agreeing with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.67,1:05:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.99,1:05:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要抽低焦油的烟 你还像刚开始抽烟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need low tar. You still smoke like a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.75,1:06:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.55,1:06:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去你我会伤心欲绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}your loss would break my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.99,1:06:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎么接话?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I supposed to say to that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.35,1:06:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说句"圣诞快乐"?  - 你讨厌圣诞节的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas?  - You hate Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.43,1:06:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 也许是甜酒里被下了什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Perhaps there was something in the punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.19,1:06:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有道理 多喝点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly. Go and have some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.67,1:06:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克让我们见他的父母 是有什么用意?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you realise that Sherlock got us out here to see his mum and dad for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.39,1:06:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的父母婚姻很幸福 我明白他的用心\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lovely mum and dad, a fine example of married life, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.71,1:06:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克就是这样 总是出其不意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the thing with Sherlock, it's always the unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿? 玛丽?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi. Oi? Mary?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.59,1:06:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊! 玛丽? 快坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ! Mary? Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.67,1:06:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽 能听见我说话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.03,1:06:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别喝玛丽的茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drink Mary's tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.15,1:06:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或她的甜酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.95,1:07:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我怀孕的妻子下药了?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you just drug my pregnant wife?!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.91,1:07:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心 维金斯是个出色的药剂师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Wiggins is an excellent chemist.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.27,1:07:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲自给你妻子下的药量 不会有一点伤害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I calculated your wife's dose myself. Won't affect the little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.63,1:07:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会照顾好她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.75,1:07:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会等着他们醒来 这本来就是做这工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll monitor their recovery. It's more or less his day job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.79,1:07:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在干吗?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.07,1:07:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deal with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.43,1:07:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不在医院里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be in hospital?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.27,1:07:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是医院 医院食堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in hospital. This is the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.87,1:07:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 我觉得是 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it?  - In my opinion, yes. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.19,1:07:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.99,1:07:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正想到你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.43,1:07:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也正在想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.59,1:07:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.39,1:07:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看阿普尔多尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see Appledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.47,1:07:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把所有秘密 所有文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you keep all the secrets, all the files,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.23,1:07:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有要挟别人的证据都藏在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything you've got on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.51,1:07:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能邀请我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to invite me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.59,1:08:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你觉得我会那么不谨慎?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I'd be so careless?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.11,1:08:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我觉得你比看起来更粗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think you're a lot more careless than you let on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.47,1:08:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.39,1:08:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呆滞的眼神泄露了你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the dead-eyed stare that gives it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.59,1:08:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非那并不是呆滞 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except it's not dead-eyed, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.15,1:08:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直在阅读\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.75,1:08:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,便携式阿普尔多尔 怎么个情况?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portable Appledore. How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.55,1:08:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植入式硬盘? 4G无线网?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built-in flash drive? 4G wireless?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.51,1:08:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是普通的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just ordinary spectacles.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.23,1:09:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.59,1:09:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(弱点: 吗啡)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.19,1:09:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你低估我了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You underestimate me, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.19,1:09:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你让我看看你的真本事 让我看看阿普尔多尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impress me, then. Show me Appledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.43,1:09:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每件东西都有代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is available for a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.59,1:09:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用什么来交换?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you making me an offer?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.35,1:09:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.19,1:09:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会送我什么作为圣诞礼物 福尔摩先生?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you giving me for Christmas, Mr Holmes?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.59,1:09:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.63,1:09:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 请你快告诉我你没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, please tell me you haven't just gone out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.07,1:09:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是自己猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather keep you guessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.35,1:10:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 飞机来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, there's our lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.67,1:10:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.91,1:10:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.39,1:10:11.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想让你妻子平安无事吗?  - 我当然想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want your wife to be safe?  - Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.31,1:10:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 因为这件事非常的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, because this is going to be incredibly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍有差错 就会违反英国安全法 就会因叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}One false move and we'll have betrayed the security of the United Kingdom and be in prison
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.47,1:10:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去蹲监狱 麦努森是我们遇到的最难缠的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}for high treason. Magnussen is the most dangerous man we've ever encountered
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.79,1:10:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成败都在此一举\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the odds are comprehensively stacked against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.47,1:10:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 今天可是圣诞节!  - 确实很有节日气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's Christmas!  - I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.87,1:10:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你说的是真正的圣诞节 你听我的话 带上枪了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean it's actually Christmas. Did you bring your gun, as I suggested?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.11,1:10:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你父母家参加圣诞节宴会为什么要带枪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I bring my gun to your parents' house for Christmas dinner?!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.91,1:10:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在大衣口袋里?  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it in your coat?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.03,1:10:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那我们出发吧  - 出发去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Off we go, then.  - Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.03,1:10:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去阿普尔多尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.23,1:11:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也来一杯吧 这可是上等好酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would offer you a drink, but it's very rare and expensive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是你策划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.87,1:11:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.63,1:11:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发现想要找到你的弱点真不容易 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very hard to find a pressure point on you, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.23,1:11:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可从来不信你有毒瘾这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drugs thing I never believed for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.15,1:11:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算暴露了 你也不在乎 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you wouldn't care if it was exposed, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.43,1:11:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你真的很在乎约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look how you care about John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.55,1:12:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待解救的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your damsel in distress.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.51,1:12:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了威胁他 你要把我烧死?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put me in a fire, for leverage?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.31,1:12:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我才不会烧死你 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I would never let you burn, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.07,1:12:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旁边有人看着的 我可不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had people standing by. I'm not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.43,1:12:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.47,1:12:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来告诉你这是怎么回事吧 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain how leverage works, Dr Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.23,1:12:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圈里人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those who understand these things,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.59,1:12:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特·福尔摩斯是英国最有权势的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft Holmes is the most powerful man in the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.55,1:12:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 除我之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apart from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.23,1:12:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特的弱点是他侦查成瘾的弟弟夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft's pressure point is his junkie detective brother, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.87,1:12:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克的弱点是他最好的朋友约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock's pressure point is his best friend, John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.83,1:12:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·华生的弱点是他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Watson's pressure point is his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.71,1:12:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制住约翰·华生的妻子 就制住了迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own John Watson's wife, I own Mycroft.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.67,1:12:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是我得到的圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's what I'm getting for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.31,1:13:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是交易 不是礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an exchange, not a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.23,1:13:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅 但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.67,1:13:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎我已经拿到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already seem to have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.71,1:13:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有密码保护的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's password protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.43,1:13:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了得到密码 你必须给我你手头所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return for the password, you will give me any material
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.63,1:13:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于玛丽·华生的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your possession pertaining to the woman I know as Mary Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.75,1:13:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 她是个坏人 害死了好多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's bad, that one. So many dead people.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.79,1:13:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你应该看看我看到的那些  - 我不用看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should see what I've seen.  - I don't need to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.43,1:13:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你会喜欢的 我就很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might enjoy it, though. I enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.31,1:13:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么不给我们看看呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you show us?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.31,1:13:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿普尔多尔? 秘密金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show you Appledore? The secret vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.95,1:13:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你想要的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.47,1:13:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要的是你手里玛丽所有的把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything you've got on Mary.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.03,1:14:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 我一直是个乐观的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I honestly expected something good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.19,1:14:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想电脑里的内容对你...  - 里面有全球定位系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I think you'll find the contents of that laptop...  - Include a GPS locator.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.83,1:14:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你哥已经发现电脑被偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}By now your brother will have noticed the theft
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.75,1:14:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的安保部队会定位到这栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the security services will be converging on this house.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.63,1:14:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们来了就会发现我手里的惊天秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having arrived, they'll find top-secret information in my hands
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.55,1:14:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是就有权利搜查我的仓库\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they have every justification to search my vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.19,1:14:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他们会发现更多证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will discover further information of this kind
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.79,1:14:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我抓去坐牢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will be imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.71,1:14:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你会被赦免 回到你的小公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would be exonerated and restored to your smelly little apartment
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.27,1:14:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续和疯子夫妇一起办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}to solve crimes with Mr and Mrs Psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.03,1:14:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特等这一天已经等了好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft has been looking for this opportunity for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.67,1:14:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会非常非常为你骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be a very, very proud big brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.95,1:14:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你知道真相 也不能阻止它的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that you know it's going to happen isn't going to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.87,1:14:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我为什么还笑得出来? 快问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why am I smiling? Ask me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.03,1:14:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么还在笑?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.07,1:14:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为夏洛克·福尔摩斯犯了个天大的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Sherlock Holmes has made one enormous mistake,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.55,1:15:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个错误会害死所有他爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will destroy the lives of everyone he loves.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.87,1:15:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及他珍惜的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything he holds dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.27,1:15:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请跟我去看看阿普尔多尔金库吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you the Appledore vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.07,1:15:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是金库入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entrance to my vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.31,1:15:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把东西都放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where I keep you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.87,1:15:46.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 金库在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so where are the vaults, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.11,1:15:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下室? 什么地下室? 这座房子里根本没有地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaults? What vaults? There are no vaults beneath this building.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.03,1:15:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.63,1:16:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿普尔多尔地下室是我的记忆宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Appledore vaults are my mind palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.11,1:16:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道记忆宫殿的 是吧 夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about mind palaces, don't you, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.63,1:16:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能记住每一件事 用图像记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to store information so you never forget it, by picturing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.71,1:16:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我坐在这里 闭上眼睛 来到我的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sit here, I close my eyes and down I go to my vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.79,1:16:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以去地下室里的任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go anywhere inside my vaults.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.71,1:16:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.55,1:16:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了华生太太的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look at the files on Mrs Watson.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.79,1:16:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.43,1:16:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 这张是我最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is one of my favourites.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.35,1:16:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太动人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.87,1:16:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为中情局做的所有勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those wet jobs for the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.63,1:17:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她做自由职业了一段时间 坏姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, she's gone a bit freelance now, bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.43,1:17:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 她可真够调皮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's so wicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.47,1:17:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂你为什么喜欢她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can really see why you like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.35,1:17:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在明白了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.95,1:17:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里根本没有什么文件是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there are no documents, you don't actually have anything here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.15,1:17:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候如果真的有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sometimes I send out for something,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.95,1:17:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会写下点什么 但通常我只是放在记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I really need it, but mostly I just remember it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.67,1:17:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.79,1:17:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你应该把这句话印在衣服上  - 你把一切放在记忆里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should have that on a T-shirt.  - You just remember it all?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.63,1:17:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认识就是一切 知道就是得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about knowledge, everything is. Knowing is owning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.43,1:17:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你只是知道 就没办法证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you just know it, then you don't have proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.59,1:17:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明? 我为什么要证明?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof? What would I need proof for?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.31,1:17:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在传媒界 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in news, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.43,1:17:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要证明 只需要让它出版\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to prove it, I just have to print it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.51,1:17:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到新闻...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of news...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.43,1:17:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天你们俩都会被大量报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll both be heavily featured tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.31,1:17:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报道说你们想将国家机密卖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to sell state secrets to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啧啧 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Tut tut.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.23,1:18:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出去吧 他们很快就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go outside. They'll be here shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.87,1:18:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等不及要看你们被逮捕啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait to see you arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.35,1:18:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我们要怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, do we have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.03,1:18:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.75,1:18:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不着急是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taking their time, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.79,1:18:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.23,1:18:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话可以印在T恤的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's the back of the T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.39,1:18:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是知道... 那有什么用呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just know things... how does that work?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.71,1:18:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢你这副士兵嘴脸 真想打一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love your little soldier face. I'd like to punch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.31,1:18:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把脸伸过来一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it over here a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.67,1:18:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伸过来 为了玛丽 把脸伸过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. For Mary. Bring me your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.35,1:18:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弯腰 把脸伸过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lean forward a bit and stick your face out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.99,1:19:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.79,1:19:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我可以弹吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, can I flick it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.87,1:19:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我 可以弹吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Can I flick your face?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.11,1:19:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是爱不释手 我可以弹一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love doing this. I could do it all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.11,1:19:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 是这样的 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it works like this, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.39,1:19:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道玛丽杀了哪些人 伤了哪些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who Mary hurt and killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.03,1:19:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道上哪去找恨她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where to find people who hate her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.87,1:19:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他们住在哪 也知道他们的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where they live, I know their phone numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.31,1:19:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都在我的记忆宫殿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in my mind palace, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.19,1:19:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就能给他们打电话 让你的日子天翻地覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could phone them right now and tear your whole life down
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.67,1:19:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.79,1:19:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你让我弹你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you let me flick your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.75,1:20:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是这么对别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do to people.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.27,1:20:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是这么对整个国家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do to whole countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.79,1:20:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就因为我有情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.07,1:20:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以弹你的眼睛吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I do your eye now?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.51,1:20:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以不让眼睛闭上吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can keep it open, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.51,1:20:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来嘛 为了玛丽 把眼睛睁开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, for Mary. Keep it open.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.47,1:20:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.79,1:20:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他弹吧 对不起 就... 让他弹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him. I'm sorry, just... let him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.43,1:20:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯? 来嘛 把眼睛睁开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Come on, eye open.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.03,1:20:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难 是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's difficult, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.35,1:20:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍宁成功了一次 发出来的声音可好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janine managed to once. She makes the funniest noises.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.31,1:20:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 约翰·华生 和那个男人保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes and John Watson, stand away from that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.91,1:20:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好戏开始啦 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.07,1:20:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再问一次 阿普尔多尔地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}To clarify, Appledore's vaults only exist in your mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.31,1:21:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只存在于你的意识中 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}nowhere else, just there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.47,1:21:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下室没有实体 从来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not real, they never have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.71,1:21:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 约翰·华生 后退!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes and John Watson, step away!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.11,1:21:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 他们动不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, they're harmless.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.03,1:21:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标没有携带武器 目标没有携带武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target is not armed, I repeat target is not armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.71,1:21:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我们怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.99,1:21:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怎么办 什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. There is nothing to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.07,1:21:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是坏人 也没有什么邪恶计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not a villain, I have no evil plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.91,1:21:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个商人 只为求财 刚好你是财源之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a businessman, acquiring assets. You happen to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.63,1:21:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 这次你当不成英雄了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, no chance for you to be a hero this time, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.55,1:21:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯 约翰·华生 立刻远离那个男人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes and John Watson, stand away from that man. Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.11,1:21:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得调查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, do your research.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.31,1:21:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是什么英雄 我是个反社会狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a hero, I'm a high-functioning sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.39,1:21:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.43,1:21:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标被击毙 目标被击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man down, man down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.51,1:21:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远点 约翰! 站远点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from me, John! Stay well back!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.63,1:21:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.63,1:21:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要开枪! 不要向夏洛克·福尔摩斯开枪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fire! Do not fire on Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.79,1:21:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要开枪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.43,1:21:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 夏洛克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Christ, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.27,1:22:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替我向玛丽问声好 告诉她现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give my love to Mary. Tell her she's safe now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.31,1:22:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.95,1:22:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都做了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.95,1:22:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我同事常挂在嘴边的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my colleague is fond of remarking,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.23,1:22:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时 这个国家就需要一把钝器\N{\fnArial\fs30}this country sometimes needs a blunt instrument.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.47,1:23:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同理 有时也需要匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equally, it sometimes needs a dagger,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.23,1:23:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一把精准 毫无悔意的手术刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}a scalpel wielded with precision and without remorse.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.75,1:23:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯总会有发挥作用的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will always come a time when we need Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.27,1:23:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是碍于亲情才这么说的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is some expression of familial sentiment...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.39,1:23:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么蠢话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.59,1:23:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对兄弟同情泛滥不是我的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not given to outbursts of brotherly compassion.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.55,1:23:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道另一个是什么下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happened to the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.51,1:23:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何 无论我们把夏洛克关在哪一间监狱里 \N{\fnArial\fs30}In any event, there is no prison in which we could incarcerate Sherlock
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.23,1:23:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定每天要不得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}without causing a riot on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.59,1:23:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但另一个处置方式 还需要你的首肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alternative, however, would require your approval.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.31,1:23:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种方式说不上宽容 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly merciful, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.23,1:23:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗憾的是 我的弟弟是个杀人犯 斯莫尔伍德女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regrettably, Lady Smallwood, my brother is a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.43,1:24:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会替我照顾他的 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will look after him for me, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.83,1:24:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 别担心 我会让他没好日子过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Don't worry. I'll keep him in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.99,1:24:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.11,1:24:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以后大概都没有和约翰·华生说话的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this is likely to be the last conversation I'll have with John Watson,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.39,1:24:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让我们单独聊几句吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you mind if we took a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.35,1:24:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来说几句吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.15,1:24:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威廉·夏洛克·斯科特·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Sherlock Scott Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.07,1:24:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.19,1:24:34.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的全名 如果你要给孩子取名 可以参考\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the whole of it. If you're looking for baby names.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.03,1:24:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 我们做了B超 可以确定是个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we've had a scan, we're pretty sure it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.87,1:24:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.51,1:24:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.47,1:24:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道实际上 我不知道要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, actually, I can't think of a single thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.07,1:24:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, neither can I.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.19,1:24:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.47,1:24:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不会结束的 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is never over, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.35,1:24:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但会有新的玩家加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there may be some new players now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.39,1:25:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没事 到最后东风神会做个了断  - 什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's OK, the East Wind takes us all in the end.  - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.47,1:25:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小时候我哥哥跟我说的一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a story my brother told me when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.19,1:25:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东风神摧枯拉朽 有万钧之力 席卷万物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The East Wind is a terrifying force that lays waste to all in its path.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.71,1:25:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它找出那些无用的东西 将它们连根拔起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seeks out the unworthy and plucks them from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.15,1:25:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是在说我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was generally me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.35,1:25:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着不错!  - 我哥哥就是废话多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice!  - He's a rubbish big brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.23,1:25:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你现在要怎么办? 你要去哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about you, then? Where are you actually going now?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.27,1:25:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去东欧执行什么卧底任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, some undercover work in Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.87,1:25:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去多久?\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.27,1:25:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据我哥哥估计得六个月 他没说错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months, my brother estimates. He's never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.47,1:25:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那之后呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.11,1:25:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.39,1:25:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰 有些事我得告诉你 我一直都想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, there's something I should say, I've meant to say always
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.23,1:25:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是从来没说出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I never have.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.67,1:25:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然我们以后大概都见不着了 我就现在说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since it's unlikely we'll ever meet again, I might as well say it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.23,1:26:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏洛克是女孩子的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock is actually a girl's name.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.95,1:26:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.15,1:26:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好你就信了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.35,1:26:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会给女儿起和你一样的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not naming our daughter after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.59,1:26:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我同名也不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think it could work.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.79,1:26:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我们在一起的好时光 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the very best of times, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.71,1:27:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史密斯把球带入禁区 很有希望进球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smith brings it inside. This looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.27,1:27:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡桑德拉接球射门 没射中!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassandra comes in for a shot. Ooh, he missed it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.67,1:27:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 电视有点问题 兄弟 电视坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, there's something wrong with the telly. There's something wrong with the telly, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.79,1:27:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.35,1:27:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.91,1:27:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想我吗? 你想我吗? \N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me? Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.15,1:27:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.83,1:27:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 但全国的电视上都看得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know, but it's on every screen in the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.67,1:27:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时在所有频道上播出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every screen simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.15,1:27:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首相知道了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the Prime Minister been told?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.07,1:27:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mycroft?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.43,1:27:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这不可能 怎么可能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not possible. That is simply not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.43,1:27:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了?  - 先生? 您哥哥的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happened?  - Sir? It's your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.67,1:27:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.75,1:27:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好呀 小弟弟 放逐之行如何了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, little brother. How's the exile going?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.19,1:27:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞机才起飞4分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only been gone four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.67,1:27:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你已经学乖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I certainly hope you've learnt your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.87,1:28:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在情况是 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it turns out, you're needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.71,1:28:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 别想一出是一出!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake, make up your mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.83,1:28:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是谁需要我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs me this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.19,1:28:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想我了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.79,1:28:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想我了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.39,1:28:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}England.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.95,1:28:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他已经死呀 你不是告诉我莫里亚蒂已经死了呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's dead. I mean, you told me he was dead, Moriarty?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.55,1:28:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死透了 他自己往脑袋开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. Blew his own brains out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.43,1:28:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他怎么又回来了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how can he be back?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.43,1:28:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他真复活了 最好穿暖和点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well if he is, he'd better wrap up warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.55,1:28:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东风神就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an East Wind coming.
